  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GreenRoots Women`s Farm Labs - a territorial incubation initiative for women-led green microbusiness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This sub-programme aims at developing, testing and progressively refining a new incubation model designed specifically for women-led green micro-business at the energy-agriculture nexus, building on FFS principles for developing local capacities while mobilizing existing FFS networks to organize co-creation and on-demand support around women micro-entrepreneurs.</narrative>
  </description>
